OL,4,BAustralia's Barty elected into Tennis  
OL,5,BHall of Fame                           
OL,6,GAustralia's Ash Barty says she felt a  
OL,7,Gsense of "impostor syndrome" after     
OL,8,Gbeing elected to the International     
OL,9,GTennis Hall of Fame.                   
OL,11,FThe former world number one and three- 
OL,12,Ftime Grand Slam singles champion will  
OL,13,Fbe inducted at a ceremony in Rhode     
OL,14,FIsland in August next year.            
OL,16,FThe 30-year-old joins an illustrious   
OL,17,Fgroup of former players in the hall of 
OL,18,Ffame, including Roger Federer, Billie  
OL,19,FJean King and Margaret Court.          
